namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamDialog {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog
    src   "A dialog whose hierarchy is code, not an asset: a dimmer, a centred panel, a title, a content\narea with a message in it, and a row of buttons.\n\nWHAT IT DOES NOT DO, because UDreamUIModalSubsystem already does it. Opened through ShowModal the\ndialog is parented to that subsystem's modal LAYER, which is itself the scrim (a full-rect tinted\nrect block), carries the UUIEventBlocker that eats every pointer event aimed at the world beneath,\nsorts above the page band, and pushes a UDreamUIModalScope that confines gamepad focus and gives\nBack the meaning \"close with the Back result\". None of that is re-implemented here. The division\nis: the SUBSYSTEM owns the screen (dimming, input blocking, focus, one-at-a-time queueing and\ncarrying the result back to the caller); the DIALOG owns the panel (what it says, which buttons it\noffers, which result each of them means) and ends the modal by calling CloseTopModal.\n\nThe dimmer part therefore exists for the OTHER supported arrangement -- standalone. Dropped into a\n.dui as an ordinary widget (asleep, woken when something needs to ask a question) there is no\nsubsystem layer above it, so the dialog's own dimmer is the only thing darkening the screen and\nits UUIEventBlocker the only thing stopping clicks reaching what is behind. When a host IS already\nscrimming -- detected as a blocker anywhere up the parent chain, which is exactly what the modal\nlayer carries -- the dialog puts its own dimmer away rather than darkening the screen twice.\nBoth arrangements are supported; nothing about the tree changes between them.\n\nButtons are real Native.Button instances rather than hand-built faces, so a project styles its\nbuttons once and dialog buttons follow. FDreamDialogStyle carries Button and PrimaryButton for\nexactly this, and the created buttons are switched to Inline style source: the dialog style has\nALREADY resolved (sheet or instance) and the look it names must win, or every dialog button would\nquietly re-resolve to the sheet's plain button and those two style fields would do nothing.\n\nOn the button LIST and .dui: the language has no array literal yet, exactly as Native.Dropdown's\nOptions honestly says. Buttons is still fillable from C++, from Blueprint and from the details\npanel -- and the constructor seeds Cancel + OK (OK primary), so the common dialog needs no array\nat all:\n\n    /Script/DreamGUIControls.DreamDialog Confirm {\n        Title   = \"删除存档\"\n        Message = \"这个操作不能撤销。\"\n        OnDialogClosed -> HandleAnswer\n    }\n\nA fixed OK/Cancel pair with an enum would have spelled that same case no better and had nothing to\nsay about the three-button one, which is why the array won."
    text  "对话框的层级由代码而非资产构建：一层遮罩、一个居中面板、一个标题、一个带消息的内容区域，\n以及一行按钮。\n\n它不做的事，因为 UDreamUIModalSubsystem 已经做了。通过 ShowModal 打开时，\n对话框会挂到该子系统的模态 LAYER 下，这一层本身就是遮罩（一个铺满矩形的着色块），\n携带 UUIEventBlocker，吃掉所有指向下方世界的指针事件，\n排序在页面带之上，并推入一个 UDreamUIModalScope，限制手柄焦点，\n并赋予 Back“以 Back 结果关闭”的含义。这些在这里都没有重新实现。分工是：\nSUBSYSTEM 掌管屏幕（变暗、输入拦截、焦点、逐个排队以及把结果带回给调用方）；\nDIALOG 掌管面板（它说什么、提供哪些按钮、每个按钮代表哪个结果），\n并通过调用 CloseTopModal 结束模态。\n\n因此遮罩部分是为另一种受支持的布置而存在的——独立使用。\n作为普通控件放进 .dui 时（休眠，在有东西需要提问时唤醒），上方没有子系统层，\n所以对话框自身的遮罩是唯一让屏幕变暗的东西，\n它的 UUIEventBlocker 也是唯一阻止点击到达背后的东西。\n当宿主已经在做遮罩时——通过在父级链上任意位置检测到 blocker 来判断，\n而这正是模态层所携带的——对话框会收起自己的遮罩，而不是把屏幕变暗两次。\n两种布置都受支持；它们之间树的结构没有任何变化。\n\n按钮是真正的 Native.Button 实例，而不是手工拼出来的外观，\n因此项目只需给按钮设一次样式，对话框按钮就会跟随。\nFDreamDialogStyle 正是为此携带 Button 和 PrimaryButton，\n而创建出的按钮会切换到 Inline 样式源：对话框样式已经解析完毕（来自样式表或实例），\n它指定的外观必须胜出，否则每个对话框按钮都会悄悄重新解析为样式表里的普通按钮，那两个样式字段就形同虚设。\n\n关于按钮 LIST 与 .dui：这门语言还没有数组字面量，\n正如 Native.Dropdown 的 Options 所坦率说明的那样。Buttons 仍然可以从 C++、蓝图和细节面板填充——\n而且构造函数会预置 Cancel + OK（OK 为主按钮），\n所以常见的对话框完全不需要数组：\n\n    /Script/DreamGUIControls.DreamDialog Confirm {\n        Title   = \"删除存档\"\n        Message = \"这个操作不能撤销。\"\n        OnDialogClosed -> HandleAnswer\n    }\n\n用枚举写死的 OK/Cancel 组合既不会把那同一种情况表达得更好，\n对三按钮的情况也无可奉告，这就是数组胜出的原因。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:BackScope {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:BackScope
    src   "The navigation scope, added only while standalone: it takes focus when the dialog appears, gives it back when\nthe dialog closes, answers Back while bCloseOnBack asks, and keeps the pad and Tab inside the dialog while it is\ndimmed, whatever bCloseOnBack says. It belongs to the dialog's owning player. See UDreamDialogScope."
    text  "导航作用域，仅在独立使用时添加：对话框出现时它获取焦点，对话框关闭时归还焦点，\n在 bCloseOnBack 要求时响应 Back，并在对话框变暗期间把手柄和 Tab 保持在对话框内，\n无论 bCloseOnBack 怎么说。它属于对话框的所属玩家。参见 UDreamDialogScope。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:bCloseOnBack {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:bCloseOnBack
    src   "Back (Escape, or the pad's B) closes this dialog with its cancel result.\n\nOnly while STANDALONE. Hosted by UDreamUIModalSubsystem the modal layer's own scope already\nanswers Back -- with the \"Back\" result its header promises whoever called ShowModal -- and a\nsecond scope on top of it would quietly change that answer. So this fills the hole the\nsubsystem does not cover rather than overruling the half it does."
    text  "Back（Escape 或手柄的 B）会以取消结果关闭此对话框。\n\n仅在独立使用时。由 UDreamUIModalSubsystem 承载时，模态层自己的作用域已经\n响应 Back——使用其头文件向调用 ShowModal 的一方承诺的“Back”结果——\n在其之上再加第二个作用域会悄悄改变那个答案。因此这里填补的是\n子系统未覆盖的空缺，而不是推翻它已覆盖的那一半。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:bCloseOnDimmerClick {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:bCloseOnDimmerClick
    src   "Clicking the dimmer closes the dialog with its cancel result -- the \"click outside to dismiss\"\nevery desktop dialog has.\n\nOff by default, and deliberately: a dialog asking a question that MATTERS (\"delete this save?\")\nmust not be dismissable by a stray click, which is why UMG's own dialogs make this opt-in too.\nOnly ever reachable while the dialog's own dimmer is up -- under the modal subsystem the layer\nis what eats clicks, and it is not this control's to put a button on."
    text  "点击遮罩会以取消结果关闭对话框——即每个桌面对话框都有的\n“点击外部关闭”。\n\n默认关闭，且是有意为之：提出重要问题（“删除这个存档？”）的对话框\n绝不能因为一次误点就被关闭，这也是 UMG 自己的对话框同样把它设为可选的原因。\n只有在对话框自身的遮罩存在时才可能触发——在模态子系统下，吃掉点击的是那一层，\n而那一层并不归此控件所有，无法为它添加按钮。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:bFocusDefaultButton {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:bFocusDefaultButton
    src   "Put focus on the default button when the dialog appears.\n\nThe default button is the PRIMARY one (the confirming one, by convention), or the last in the\nrow when none is marked. Without this a dialog opened with a gamepad came up with focus\nwherever the previous screen left it, so the first press went to a control behind the scrim."
    text  "对话框出现时将焦点放在默认按钮上。\n\n默认按钮是 PRIMARY 按钮（按惯例即确认按钮），若没有任何按钮被标记，\n则是行中的最后一个。没有这一项时，用手柄打开的对话框会把焦点留在上一个界面\n留下的位置，于是第一次按键会落到遮罩后面的控件上。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:BodyNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:BodyNode
    src   "The hole in the middle band. Empty is the normal state; what a host puts here replaces the\nbuilt-in message, which is its overlay sibling rather than its child for exactly that reason."
    text  "中间带上的空缺。空是正常状态；宿主放在这里的内容会替换内置消息，\n正因如此内置消息是它的覆盖同级而不是它的子级。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:bShowDimmer {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:bShowDimmer
    src   "Whether this dialog darkens the screen itself.\n\nTrue means \"dim unless somebody above me already is\" -- a host that scrims (the modal\nsubsystem's layer) is honoured automatically at construct time, so leaving this on costs a\nmodal dialog nothing. False is the opt-out for a dialog deliberately shown over a live screen."
    text  "此对话框是否自行让屏幕变暗。\n\nTrue 表示“除非上方已经有人变暗，否则变暗”——会做遮罩的宿主（模态\n子系统的层）在构造时会被自动尊重，所以保持开启对模态对话框没有任何代价。\nFalse 则是为故意显示在活动屏幕之上的对话框准备的退出选项。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:Buttons {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:Buttons
    src   "One Native.Button per entry, left to right. Seeded with Cancel + OK; see the class comment.\n\nBlueprintReadOnly rather than a BlueprintSetter pair, which is the other half of the same\nrule: the specs are what the button WIDGETS are made from, so a Blueprint writing this array\nin place used to change the data and leave the row built from the old copy -- a dialog showing\nbuttons it no longer has. SetButtons is the way in, and it reconciles the widgets. The designer\nand .dui still author it directly (EditAnywhere), where PostEditChangeProperty does the same."
    text  "每个条目对应一个 Native.Button，从左到右。预置为 Cancel + OK；参见类注释。\n\n用 BlueprintReadOnly 而不是 BlueprintSetter 对，这是同一条规则的另一半：\n这些规格是构建按钮 WIDGET 的依据，所以蓝图就地写入此数组时，\n过去只改变数据，却让按钮行仍由旧副本构建——对话框显示着它已不再拥有的按钮。\nSetButtons 才是正确的入口，它会协调这些控件。设计器和 .dui 仍可直接编辑它\n（EditAnywhere），在那里 PostEditChangeProperty 也起同样的作用。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:ButtonWidgets {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:ButtonWidgets
    src   "One per entry in Buttons, in order. Rebuilt whenever the specs change."
    text  "按顺序，Buttons 中的每个条目对应一个。规格变化时重建。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:CancelResult {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:CancelResult
    src   "What Close is called with when the dialog is cancelled rather than answered -- RequestCancel,\nand whatever a project routes Escape or Back to.\n\nNone (the default) resolves it from the button row instead of guessing: the first NON-primary\nbutton's result, because that is what \"Cancel\" is in every row this control builds, falling\nback to the last button's and finally to \"Cancel\". Naming it explicitly wins over all of that."
    text  "对话框被取消而非回答时，调用 Close 所使用的参数——RequestCancel，\n以及项目把 Escape 或 Back 路由到的任何地方。\n\nNone（默认值）会从按钮行推导而不是猜测：第一个非主按钮的结果，\n因为在这个控件构建的每一行里那就是“Cancel”，若没有则回退到最后一个按钮的结果，\n最后再回退到“Cancel”。显式指定会胜过这一切。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:Close {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:Close
    src   "End the dialog with InResult.\n\nHosted by the modal subsystem this is CloseTopModal -- the subsystem pops the focus scope,\ndelivers the result to whoever called ShowModal, destroys the layer and shows the next queued\ndialog. Standalone it simply puts the dialog to sleep, which is the state a .dui-placed dialog\nwas in before it was shown. Either way OnDialogClosed has already fired."
    text  "用InResult结束对话框。\n\n由模态子系统承载时，它就是CloseTopModal——子系统弹出焦点作用域，\n把结果交给调用ShowModal的一方，销毁该层并显示下一个排队的\n对话框。独立运行时，它只是让对话框休眠，这正是.dui中放置的对话框\n在显示之前所处的状态。无论哪种方式，OnDialogClosed都已触发。"
    state machine
}

