DreamDialog:SetShowDimmer {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:SetShowDimmer
    src   "Whether this dialog darkens the screen itself, re-decided at once.\n\nA setter because the knob used to be read in exactly one place -- the construct-time host\narrangement -- so turning it off in the designer or at runtime changed nothing anyone could\nsee until the next time the dialog was built."
    text  "此对话框是否自行使屏幕变暗，会立即重新判定。\n\n做成设置器是因为这个开关过去只在一处被读取——构造时的宿主\n安排——因此在设计器或运行时关掉它，直到下次构建对话框之前\n都不会有任何可见的变化。"
    state machine
}

