    text  "此实例自身的外观。当StyleSource如此指示且项目中确实存在样式表时，项目样式表\n优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，它本身就是生效的外观——因此\n它保持可编辑，而不受枚举限制。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:SubmitDefaultButton {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:SubmitDefaultButton
    src   "Answer as the default button would -- UMG's \"Enter presses the default\".\n\nEnter already reaches a FOCUSED button as a click (it is one of the standalone input actor's\nnavigation trigger keys), and bFocusDefaultButton puts focus there when the dialog opens, so\nthe ordinary case needs nothing. This is the same answer for the case where focus has since\nmoved somewhere that is not a button at all -- a body slot's text field, say -- and for code\nthat wants to confirm without a pointer. A default button that is disabled answers nothing,\nexactly as it would to a click."
    text  "以默认按钮的方式应答——即UMG的“Enter按下默认按钮”。\n\nEnter本就以点击的形式送达获得焦点的按钮（它是独立输入Actor的\n导航触发键之一），而bFocusDefaultButton会在对话框打开时将焦点放到那里，\n所以常规情况无需额外处理。当焦点之后移到根本不是按钮的地方时\n——比如正文章节的文本字段——此处给出同样的应答；对于想在没有指针的情况下\n确认的代码也是如此。被禁用的默认按钮不应答，\n与点击它的效果完全相同。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialog:Title {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialog:Title
    src   "Empty puts the title away entirely rather than reserving a blank line for it.\n\nBlueprintSetter, like every writable knob on this control: nothing re-derives a control from a\nproperty that changed (the SynchronizeProperties tax UDreamUIControl documents), so a runtime\nwrite straight onto the variable moved the text and left the panel saying the old thing."
    text  "Empty 会完全移除标题，而不是为它保留空行。\n\nBlueprintSetter 这个蓝图设置器，和此控件上的每个可写旋钮一样：不会根据已更改的属性重新派生控件\n（UDreamUIControl 文档中所述的 SynchronizeProperties 开销），所以直接对变量进行运行时\n写入，文本变了，面板却仍显示旧内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamDialogButton {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDialog.h#DreamDialogButton
    src   "One button in a dialog's row: what it says, what it answers, and whether it is the loud one.\n\nA struct rather than a pair of fixed OK/Cancel knobs because a dialog's button row is genuinely\nvariable -- \"Save / Don't Save / Cancel\" is as ordinary as \"OK / Cancel\" -- and because the RESULT\nis the dialog's whole output. Naming it per button is what lets a caller distinguish the three\nwithout counting indices."
    text  "对话框按钮行中的一个按钮：显示什么文字、应答什么结果，以及它是否是那个显眼的按钮。\n\n采用结构体而非固定的确定/取消两个开关，是因为对话框的按钮行确实\n多变——“保存/不保存/取消”与“确定/取消”一样常见——而且结果（RESULT）\n就是对话框的全部输出。为每个按钮命名，调用方才能区分这三个按钮\n而无需数索引。"
    state machine
}

